{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568540/extras/super.gif?t=1743612252\" />ABOUT THIS DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Captain Carnage demo begins on a broken road. A group of supervillains have stolen top-secret documents. The mission is to find the stolen documents and return them before they are misused.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568540/extras/dash.gif?t=1743612252\" /><br>FEATURES IN THIS DEMO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 enemy types (including 1 boss and 2 mini-bosses)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light and heavy attacks (air and ground)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, double jump, dash jump, dash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform into Super Captain Carnage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 special attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 finishers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End-of-level stats (including time tracking, relevant for speedruns)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Backstory (in the HUB)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special assist system for playing with a controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Languages: English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, Japanese, Chinese (Simplified)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568540/extras/shooting.gif?t=1743612252\" /><br>PLAY AS A SUPERHERO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this exciting genre-mix of Hack and Slash and Third Person Shooter you will play as <strong>Captain Carnage</strong> - a badass superhero - and save the world from various supervillains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.aka